  "details": "Description\n\nPressing the Y key in the game brings up the chat box, but it only shows 'typing...' and doesn't display the content.But I can type and communicate through the OSC panel, and chatting works normally then.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nClear the cache files and use Steam's VRC beta version.\n\nMaybe you also need to open the OSC panel?\n\nI don't know the exact steps to reproduce it, but after I cleared the cache and changed the cache directory from the C drive to the D drive, it happened again when I reopened it.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 用户界面\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1918-8b1f448883-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-01_10-09-35.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_8c71669e-1059-4989-bd7a-55f3f0a71a97/1/file)",
